---
description: "Audit, certificates, and client-facing API masking"
globs: ["services/sentinel-api/src/modules/audit/**", "services/sentinel-api/src/modules/certificates/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
# Compliance guardrails
1. Every state mutation appends to `audit_events` (userId, IP, payload hash chain).
2. Never expose tape barcode, rack, or slot in client-facing API responses.
3. Certificates: PDF + RSA-SHA256; store PDF SHA-256 in DB.
